# Private registry auth for hosted billing. `@talesofai-billing/sdk` is an
# optional *runtime* dependency (billing simply disables itself when it is
# absent), but it is a required *build-time* dependency for the billing and
# space-commerce code paths — typechecking and building `@cohub/billing` and
# `apps/api` will fail without it.
#
# Provide the token through trusted config. pnpm v11+ ignores ${...} placeholders
# in the repository .npmrc (the committed scope routing there is non-secret), so
# set the token in the global config instead:
#
#   pnpm config set //git.talesofai.com/api/packages/talesofai/npm/:_authToken "$GITEA_NPM_TOKEN"
#
# CI/Docker inject the same line into the trusted home/root .npmrc.
